(7602538, 1228412, 101256, '<td valign="top">I think I get it, but it''s pretty subtle - BUT, the conversion is nearly perfect - I really enjoy candid photography and this is as good as any I''ve seen here.</td>', 'I think I get it, but it''s pretty subtle - BUT, the conversion is nearly perfect - I really enjoy candid photography and this is as good as any I''ve seen here.', '2018-11-14 16:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
